OL,3,AMicrosoft scrambles to solve global
OL,4,Aoutage affecting Outlook and Teams but
OL,5,Asays fixes not going 'as expected'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Microsoft outage is affecting
OL,8,Fservices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,9,FAI software Copilot - here's what we
OL,10,Fknow
OL,12,FIssues started on Thursday, with
OL,13,Fmonitoring website Downdetector seeing
OL,14,Fproblems reported in more than 70
OL,15,Fcountries
OL,17,FMicrosoft says its attempts to fix the
OL,18,Fissue are not "taking as expected",
OL,19,Fadding that the issue hasn't been
OL,20,Fcaused by a cyber-security breach
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
