OL,3,AMicrosoft scrambles to solve global
OL,4,Aoutage affecting Outlook and Teams but
OL,5,Asays fixes not going 'as expected'
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK Parliament says it's affected and
OL,8,F"alternative communication arrangements
OL,9,Fare in place"; an NHS doctor says
OL,10,FMicrosoft services are "central" to GP
OL,11,Fpractices and warns of disruption; in
OL,12,FAustralia, spy and federal police
OL,13,Fagencies also report issues
OL,15,FHow are you affected? Jack, a teacher,
OL,16,Ftells us he can't access emails but
OL,17,Flesson plans are available. Meanwhile,
OL,18,FMartin says it was "bliss" to wake up
OL,19,Fto no emails - before he realised
OL,20,F"today is a crucial day to conclude a
OL,21,Fbusiness deal"
